<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.AFRICAN TRADE DATA DELAYED, NOW DUE NEXT WEEK.</title>
<headline>S.AFRICAN TRADE DATA DELAYED, NOW DUE NEXT WEEK.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>October trade data would probably only be released on Monday next week, a South African Revenue Services official said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The data had originally been scheduled for release this week.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
